{"id":"n88102-1-7","stage":3,"title":"후보 · 候选人","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n88102-1-7-1","ko":"이번 반장 선거에 지수가 후보로 나온대.","zh":"听说这次班长选举中智秀要参选呢。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"반장","meaning":"班长","explanation":"반장：班长","readings":[{"term":"반장","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57186","senseId":"3","lemma":"반장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반장","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3"}},{"text":"선거에","meaning":"选举","explanation":"선거：选举；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"선거","audio":"/audio/c091c2a2a2efa68e985a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16617","senseId":"1","lemma":"선거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"선거에","audio":"/audio/507d2f746d993e23365a.mp3"}},{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"후보로","meaning":"候选人","explanation":"후보：候选人；로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"후보","audio":"/audio/7baf75f51c9d0d7daeae.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"88102","senseId":"1","lemma":"후보","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"후보로","audio":"/audio/13fbfab58b16f59fda04.mp3"}},{"text":"나온대.","meaning":"出现，出场，参加","explanation":"나오다：出现，出场，参加；ㄴ대：口语中转述听来的话，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"나오다","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62233","senseId":"8","lemma":"나오다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"나온대","audio":"/audio/f3c4e68cddc1a1f3b959.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"42215d859bc4bc8e","term":"반장","zh":"班长","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3","entryId":"57186","definition":"学校里代表班级的人。","pronunciation":["반장"]},{"id":"c091c2a2a2efa68e","term":"선거","zh":"选举","audio":"/audio/c091c2a2a2efa68e985a.mp3","entryId":"16617","definition":"在一定的组织或集团内通过投票挑选代表或管理人员。","pronunciation":["선ː거"]},{"id":"7baf75f51c9d0d7d","term":"후보","zh":"候选人","audio":"/audio/7baf75f51c9d0d7daeae.mp3","entryId":"88102","definition":"在选举中，为得到某个职位或身份，具备一定资格后参加选举；或指这种人。","pronunciation":["후보"]},{"id":"038a8038eb817ffe","term":"나오다","zh":"出现，出场，参加","audio":"/audio/038a8038eb817ffef26e.mp3","entryId":"62233","definition":"在某处现身。","pronunciation":["나오다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e5ed26d93869b6867cad.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n88102-1-7-2","ko":"정말? 지수가 꼭 반장이 됐으면 좋겠다.","zh":"真的吗？我真心希望智秀能当上班长。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"정말?","meaning":"真的","explanation":"정말：真的","readings":[{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61173","senseId":"3","lemma":"정말","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"정말","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3"}},{"text":"지수가","meaning":"智秀","explanation":"지수：智秀；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지수가","audio":"/audio/979e8723b1f704e0856a.mp3"}},{"text":"꼭","meaning":"一定，必定","explanation":"꼭：一定，必定","readings":[{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"48064","senseId":"1","lemma":"꼭","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"꼭","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3"}},{"text":"반장이","meaning":"班长","explanation":"반장：班长；이：用在 아니다、되다 等前，标记否定或变化涉及的身份、状态。","readings":[{"term":"반장","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"57186","senseId":"3","lemma":"반장","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"반장이","audio":"/audio/884c952c3aee0edab1fd.mp3"}},{"text":"됐으면","meaning":"成为，变为","explanation":"되다：成为，变为；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；으면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"1","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"됐으면","audio":"/audio/d5a61b9b0e91258a650a.mp3"}},{"text":"좋겠다.","meaning":"喜爱，喜欢","explanation":"좋다：喜爱，喜欢；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；다：平叙句末，常用于书面叙述、自言自语或非敬语表达。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"10","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좋겠다","audio":"/audio/662bbd805e871b1915e9.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"6f24e21fc8cce6bd","term":"정말","zh":"真的","audio":"/audio/6f24e21fc8cce6bd9e56.mp3","entryId":"61173","definition":"用于强调自己所说的话。","pronunciation":["정ː말"]},{"id":"712da780b7ecf8b7","term":"꼭","zh":"一定，必定","audio":"/audio/712da780b7ecf8b736b3.mp3","entryId":"48064","definition":"无论有什么事情也务必。","pronunciation":["꼭"]},{"id":"42215d859bc4bc8e","term":"반장","zh":"班长","audio":"/audio/42215d859bc4bc8e6a78.mp3","entryId":"57186","definition":"学校里代表班级的人。","pronunciation":["반장"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"成为，变为","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"拥有新的身份或地位。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"86d0464f1c6da402","term":"좋다","zh":"喜爱，喜欢","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3","entryId":"79033","definition":"某事或某个对象很称心、很满意。","pronunciation":["조ː타"]}],"audio":"/audio/dddce50a5397db66a7d6.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.11,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=88102","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","d